WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.420
What's up everybody!

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.240
We are Pongfinity

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.560
And today we're playing Giant Table Tennis!

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.500
1 set to 11

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.280
Loser has to crawl under the table

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:12.940
Let's go

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:13.960
Good luck!

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:17.880
0-0

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:34.800
Wrong way!

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.140
Wow! That was pretty nice!

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.580
What was that serve!?

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:31.000
That was a bit different!

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.440
I wasn't expecting that.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.780
Wow!

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:44.460
Nice!

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:06.760
So close!

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.280
Well guys, thanks for watching!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:32.820
Subscribe right here

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:34.760
There is also a ball

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.920
You should probably also go under these

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.400
The viewers want to see you go under one

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.380
I don't think they do!

